{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Oh, yeah, this city is mega crazy. And that was before it got blown up! Quick rundown of advice: Hampstead, kinda messed up. Avoid the fog. Ferrytown, bunch of fey. Careful about your words. And Kingsbridge.... well, you don't have to worry about usual Kingsbridge much tonight.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T00:34:35.355000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868290030647533628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
